' 15. Learner views statistics (overview loaded once, tabs)
' Use cases: View Japanese statistics, View study time per day, View lessons per week, View test results,
'   View Hiragana / Katakana accuracy (View statistics, Track learning progress) · Actor: Learner
'
' Design patterns:
'   - Facade: getLearningOverview() is one entry point over a dozen repositories (study time, goals, lessons,
'     assessments, kanji, reviews, mistakes, mock exams, practice, speaking), queried in parallel
'     (services/learning-statistics.service.ts)
'   - Decorator: action() wraps the controller with shared error handling (utils/action.ts)
'   - Repository
'   - Loaded once, shared by the tabs: useLearningOverview() fetches the overview when the page opens; switching
'     between Overview, Tests and Practice only changes the address and redraws from that data (web lib/learningOverview.ts)
' Lifelines use BCE stereotypes: «boundary» screens and outside services, «control» use-case logic (controllers,
' services, and the adapter interfaces in front of outside services), «entity» stored data (repository, stores);
' the database keeps its own symbol.
@startuml 15 View statistics
title 15. Learner views statistics (overview loaded once, tabs)
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor Learner
boundary "Web app\n(Statistics page)" as Web
control "Statistics controller" as Ctrl
control "Learning statistics\nservice" as Svc
control "Kana statistics\nservice" as Kana
entity "Repository" as Repo
database "Database" as DB

note over Web, Ctrl : every request goes through authenticate first (not drawn)

Learner -> Web : open Statistics (/statistics/japanese/overview)
par overview
  Web -> Ctrl : GET /api/statistics/overview
  Ctrl -> Svc : getLearningOverview(userId)
  group «Facade», queried in parallel (Promise.all)
    Svc -> Repo : study seconds per day (30 days), daily goal
    Svc -> Repo : lessons completed, lessons per week
    Svc -> Repo : assessment results, mock exam results
    Svc -> Repo : kanji mastery, review deck summary, reviews per day
    Svc -> Repo : mistakes, practice sessions, speaking by level
    Repo -> DB : SELECT … (one query each)
  end
  Svc -> Svc : totals: time studied, days the goal was met
  Ctrl --> Web : overview
else kana
  Web -> Ctrl : GET /api/statistics
  Ctrl -> Kana : getStatistics(userId)
  Kana -> Repo : hiragana and katakana answers per character
  Repo -> DB : SELECT …
  Ctrl --> Web : accuracy and mastery per character
end
alt a request fails
  Web -> Web : show "Your learning statistics could not be loaded." + Try again
else
  Web -> Web : show Overview: study time chart, lessons per week, goal days
end

Learner -> Web : Tests tab (/statistics/japanese/tests)
note right of Web : no request: drawn from the overview\nalready loaded
Web -> Web : show assessment and mock exam results (chart, or as a table)

Learner -> Web : Kana tab → filter "learning", open a character
Web -> Web : show the character's accuracy, attempts and status
@enduml
